     AETHER_LICENSE_ACCEPTED=I_ACCEPT_AETHER_LICENSE

   or by calling aether_accept_license() from the C API after presenting
   this LICENSE to an authorized human operator. See docs/LICENSE_ACCEPTANCE.md.

1. Grant of rights (authorized use only)

   Subject to the conditions below, you may use, copy, modify, and
   build this software **only** for:

   - defensive security research and education
   - authorized red-team / purple-team lab exercises
   - product evaluation of metamorphic / poly techniques
   - detection engineering and academic publication of defensive findings
   - private use that is **lawful** and **authorized** on systems you own
     or have explicit written permission to test (including internal company
     and properly authorized private legal / security work)

   "Private" does **not** mean unrestricted personal misuse. Unauthorized
   access, spreading, or production of covert malware for illegal ends is
   prohibited.

